      "writtenOn": "2024-10-07T05:51:05Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "How about I change the default value to `true` and remove the Floss build flag?\n\nThe rationale is no matter client is CrOS or desktop. We should prefer software path. We consider the offload path as a fallback path for hfp.\n\nSince `bluetooth.hfp.software_datapath.enabled` is recently introduced and we have never set this flag on CrOS so the default value always `true`. The `enable_offload` will not be run on CrOS. So this should not alter any behaviour on CrOS.",
      "parentUuid": "f27be51f_58404b1b",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 297,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 297,
        "endChar": 20
      },
